{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["赞美之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华啊！你是我的上帝，我要尊崇你，赞美你的名。你信实无比，",{"text":"按你古时定下的计划行了奇妙的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使城邑沦为废墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使坚垒沦为荒场。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人的宫殿不复存在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远不能重建。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，强大的民必颂扬你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"残暴之邦的城邑必敬畏你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是贫穷人的避难所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是困苦之人患难中的避难所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是避风港，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是酷暑中的阴凉处。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"残暴之徒的气息好像吹袭墙垣的暴风，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像干旱之地的热气。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你平息外族人的喧哗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"止息残暴之徒的歌声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像云朵消去酷热。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在锡安山上，万军之耶和华必为天下万民摆设丰盛的宴席，有陈年佳酿和精选的美食。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["在这山上，祂必除去遮蔽万民的面纱和笼罩万国的幔子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂必永远吞灭死亡。主耶和华必擦去各人脸上的眼泪，从世上除掉祂子民的羞辱。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，人们必说：“看啊，这是我们的上帝，我们信靠祂，祂拯救了我们。这是耶和华，我们信靠祂，我们要因祂的救恩而欢喜快乐。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华必伸手保护这山，但摩押人必在本地被践踏，像干草被践踏在粪池中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他们必在里面张开手臂，好像张开手臂游泳的人一样。耶和华必摧毁他们的骄傲，挫败他们手中的诡计。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂必拆毁他们高大坚固的城墙，将其夷为平地、化为尘土。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}